# Layer A form: Handler intercepts Filesystem.Read and supplies the
# fixed config text as Bytes; program returns bytesLen = 10. The
# handle lambda must be (String) -> Bytes to match fsRead. Probes
# HandlerSignatureMismatch on a zero-arg or String-returning handle.
# Uses the prelude fsRead/readFx (the prelude entry carries the
# Q-039 projection) plus prelude stringT/fromUtf8/bytesLen; the
# remaining nodes are written in explicit (non-sugared) form.
@v=1 root=outer
cfgPath STR "/etc/app.conf"
readCall APP fsRead [cfgPath]
bodyLen APP bytesLen [readCall]
cfgText STR "debug=true"
cfgBytes APP fromUtf8 [cfgText]
p PRC "p" stringT
handleLam LAM [p] cfgBytes
outer H readFx handleLam bodyLen
